        { kind: "transfer", md: `Any "how fast is X changing right now" question is a derivative: current is the rate of charge flow, reaction rate is the rate concentration changes, power is the rate energy is delivered. Whenever the exam gives you a quantity as a function of something else and asks for a rate, this is the tool.` }
